{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：10:34 2026-06-21 HKT<br/>發佈時間：10:34 2026-06-21 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：10:34 2026-06-21 HKT</p><p>牛池灣發生爆竊案。今日（21日）早上9時31分，彩雲商場地下一間連鎖家品公司「日本城」分店，職員上班準備開門營業時，赫然發現店舖的後門被撬開，店內收銀櫃枱一片凌亂，於是報警。</p><p>現場是清水灣道45號，警員到場調查，初步相信店舖失竊約3,000元現金，具體損失有待點損。警方將案件列作爆竊，正翻查閉路電視片段，追緝涉案賊人。</p><img alt=\"彩雲商場「日本城」分店遭賊人爆竊。梁國峰攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/e4d0a7c6e70b2eb1683f9f2917f2b224/2026-06/WhatsApp_Image_2026-06-21_at_10_13_51_1_-_.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"警員到場調查。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/c20f3ffdbc4471c5ce212a258bf7cd6f/2026-06/WhatsApp_Image_2026-06-21_at_10_13_51_-_.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"警員在「日本城」店內調查。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/438357013422d5a4a2eb6fcc17448995/2026-06/WhatsApp_Image_2026-06-21_at_10_13_50_1_-_.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/92655575940f280b2e0b1fbeb2fbd679/2026-06/WhatsApp_Image_2026-06-21_at_10_13_50_-_.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/b73833243ebf73d070c2bfb6fb374391/2026-06/WhatsApp_Image_2026-06-21_at_10_13_49_3_-_.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/d873c3987e6b281cb920dc4938f32237/2026-06/WhatsApp_Image_2026-06-21_at_10_13_49_2_-_.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"警方調查發現賊人撬開後門，潛入店內犯案。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/7d463dc837513c834094bd207097cb48/2026-06/WhatsApp_Image_2026-06-21_at_10_13_49_1_-_.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"木門被撬開遺下損毀痕迹。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/94c3d4f8df1ed26f8fe27c2bf6b88085/2026-06/WhatsApp_Image_2026-06-21_at_10_13_48_1_.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/c45ba6f613eced869635293048691410/2026-06/WhatsApp_Image_2026-06-21_at_10_13_49_-_.jpeg\"/><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-06-21T02:38:37.691804+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":243,"images":9,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"unknown"}}